  "content": "\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enhancednature\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/short_556321.svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> \n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/enhanced-nature\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/enhanced-nature?logo=modrinth&label=&suffix=%20&style=flat&color=242629&labelColor=5ca424&logoColor=1c1c1c\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enhancednature\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/556321(266fff).svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"Поддерживаемые версии\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/hmaD7Se\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/523112426913267713?color=282828&logo=discord&style=flat&label=&labelColor=B6BCEA\" alt=\"Discord\"></a>\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/EnhancedNature/blob/main/src/main/resources/enhanced_nature_logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"logo\"/><br>\n</p>\n\n\n## 📖 Описание\n\nЭтот мод добавляет в ваш мир новые особенности генерации!\n\n-----\n\n### Особенности:\n\n- новые редкие красивые деревья\n- жилы песчаника\n- жилы песка\n- жилы булыжника\n- жилы глины\n- жилы глубинного сланца\n- жилы камня с серебряными рыбами\n- добавлен плывун\n- настраивается через датапак!\n\n-----\n\nГенерация деревьев взята из [Набора деревьев Rex](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/rexs-tree-pack)\n\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"/>\n</p>\n\n## 📷 Галерея\n\n![пальма](https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/2023-09-07_19.50.02.png?raw=true)\n\n![берёза](https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/2023-09-07_19.52.23.png?raw=true)\n\n![тёмный дуб](https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/2023-09-07_19.53.40.png?raw=true)\n\n![мёртвое дерево](https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/2023-09-07_19.54.15.png?raw=true)\n\n![дуб](https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/2023-09-07_19.55.08.png?raw=true)\n\n![плывун](https://i.imgur.com/qinjtei.png)\n\n![дополнительные жилы камня](https://i.imgur.com/22H38rA.png)\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"/>\n</p>\n\n## 🗃️ Зависимости\n\n### Обязательные:\n- **Magma Core**\n  - Предоставляет базовый код и функции, такие как проверка обновлений \n  - [CurseForge][cf_magmacore] | [Modrinth][mr_magmacore]\n\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"/>\n</p>\n\n## 🎮 Мои другие моды!\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Additional-Structures/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Дополнительные структуры\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bedrock-miner\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Bedrock-Miner/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Добытчик бедрока\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tool-upgrades\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/ToolUpgrades/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Улучшения инструментов\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-the-compatibility\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/AllTheCompatibility/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Полная совместимость\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/customized-dungeon-loot\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/2291f5f13114f09294ce5e079f8a61b8a2617a8692e68ca453674e93f1982b62/687474703a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f427065525748442e706e67\" alt=\"Кастомизированный лут подземелий\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-sticks\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/AdvancedSticks/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Продвинутые инструменты\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/age-of-weapons\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/e8e1315b08a3bd1fb144ccd47488b1df4033418ad3aee01e61cc9d6e83fa55a5/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f586d324332576a2e706e67\" alt=\"Эпоха оружия\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rune-craft\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/RuneCraft/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Рунное ремесло\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collectibles\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Collectibles/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Коллекционные предметы\" width=\"85\"/></a> <br> \n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extra-gems\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/ExtraGems/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Дополнительные драгоценные камни\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minetraps\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/MineTraps/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Ловушки для шахт\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exo-craft\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/ExoCraft/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ExoCraft\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/city-craft\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/CityCraft/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"City Craft\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upcycle\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Upcycle/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Переработка\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lexicon\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Lexicon/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Лексикон\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nexus-battle-mode\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Nexus/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Nexus\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/block-detective\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/BlockDetective/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Детектив блоков\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/suspicious-pots\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Suspicious-Pots/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Подозрительные горшки\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"/>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n<br>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/ycRJJk8EXV\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/message.png?raw=true\" alt=\"написать сообщение\"/></a>\n</p>\n\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/icons/github_icon_bg.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Github\" width=\"70\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/xxrexraptorxx\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/icons/kofi_icon_bg.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Ko-Fi\" width=\"70\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/bePatron?u=75131568\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/icons/patreon_icon_bg.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"70\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https: